course: dictionary
lesson: 14077
title: Meaningless
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Meaningless means having no meaning or no sense. A meaningless string of letters, like «xqzvb», does not say anything that anyone can understand.
explain: Something can also be meaningless when it has no purpose or importance. «The rule was meaningless, because nobody could say why it was there.» The rule did nothing useful, so the word tells you it was pointless.
explain: To check, read the sentence around the word. Swap in your meaning: if the sentence still makes no sense, you have found the right idea.
fact: Meaningless means having no meaning or no sense.
fact: Meaningless can also mean having no purpose or importance.
fact: «A meaningless string of letters» is a jumble that says nothing.
fact: «Green ideas sleep furiously» is grammatical but meaningless, because the words do not make sense together.
fact: In maths, an answer like 2.5 buses is meaningless, because you cannot have half a bus in that question.
exercise: «The code was a meaningless string of letters: QWRT ZP LK.» What does meaningless mean here? | *Having no meaning or sense | Written in gold ink | Very long and hard to read
exercise: Mia answers «How many buses are needed?» with 2.5 buses. Why is her answer meaningless? | *You cannot have half a bus, so the answer does not fit the question | It is too big | Her handwriting is messy
exercise: Which word means having no purpose or importance? | *Meaningless | Thoughtful | Lively | Bright
test: Which of these would be a meaningless sentence in a language lesson? | The sun is hot | *Green ideas sleep furiously | Dogs can run fast | Cats drink milk
test: «The promise was meaningless, because she never kept it and never meant to.» What does meaningless mean here? | Brightly coloured | Loud and clear | *Empty, with no real value | Very kind
exam: Which sentence uses meaningless correctly? | The cake was meaningless, because it tasted lovely | *The rule was meaningless, because nobody could say what it was for | The dog was meaningless, because it was brown | We ran meaningless across the field
